      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 36 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word “goods” the words “property, document or computerized data”. New section 36A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 36 the following section: “Cost of holding property, etc., seized 36A. Where any property, document or computerized data seized in the exercise of any power under this Act is held in the custody of the Government pending the completion of any proceedings in respect of an offence under this Act or the regulations, the cost of holding it in custody shall, in the event of any person being found guilty of an offence under this Act or the regulations, be a debt due to the Government by such person and shall be recoverable accordingly.”. Amendment of section 38"
      }
    },
