      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 42 of the principal Act is amended in paragraph (1)(b), by substituting for the words “handicapped person” the words “person with disability”. New section 43A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for the short title “Direct Sales Act 1993” the short title “Direct Sales and Anti-Pyramid Scheme Act 1993”. Reference to the principal Act"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 43 the following section: “Protection of informers 43A. (1) Except as provided in this section, no witness in any civil or criminal proceedings shall be obliged or permitted to disclose the name or address of any informer or the substance and nature of the information received from him or to state any matter which might lead to his discovery. (2) If any property, document or computerized data which is in evidence or liable to inspection in any civil or criminal proceedings contains any entry in which any informer is named or described or which might lead to his discovery, the court shall cause all such entries to be concealed from view or to be obliterated so far as may be necessary to protect the informer from discovery. (3) If in a trial for any offence under this Act or the regulations, the court after full inquiry into the case believes that the informer wilfully made in his complaint a material statement which he knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true, or if in any other proceedings the court is of the opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties to the proceedings without the discovery of the informer, the court may require the production of the original complaint, if in writing, and permit inquiry and require full disclosure concerning the informer.”. New section 45"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 44 the following section: “Amendment of Schedule 45. The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, amend the Schedule.”. New Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 45 the following Schedule: “SCHEDULE FEATURES OF PYRAMID SCHEME OR ARRANGEMENT [Section 27A] 1. The promotion of a scheme or the payment of bonus or other benefits is solely or primarily through recruitment or introduction of participants, into the pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process rather than the sale of goods, services or intangible property by the participants. 2. The bonus is paid to the participants or the other benefits are received by the participants solely or primarily through the recruitment or introduction of other persons into the pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process rather than the sale of goods, services or intangible property by the participants or other persons. 3. A written contract or statement which describes the material terms of the agreement is not provided to participants who join the pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process. 4. A mandatory purchase of goods, services or intangible property or a minimum payment or sale requirement is imposed as a condition to satisfy the eligibility or start-up requirement for participation or payment of bonus or other benefits in the pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process. 5. The participants are required to purchase goods, services or intangible property in unreasonable amount which exceeds the expectation to be resold or consumed within a reasonable period of time. The participants may not be given full liberty in buying but they are pressured to purchase selected goods packages to meet sales requirements to qualify them for position or bonus in the pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process. 6. The refund policy for goods, services or intangible property purchased by participants or consumers is not provided. 7. The buy-back policy by the operator of the pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process for currently marketable goods, services or intangible property upon the request of participants within reasonable terms or agreement is not allowed or provided for. 8. A strict or unreasonable structural requirements of the pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process for the eligibility of participants to be paid bonus or other benefits. 9. Withdrawal by participants from the pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process is not allowed. 10. The participants are allowed or encouraged to buy up more than one position or right to participate in the pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process. Explanation 1 - A reference to the word “bonus or other benefits” shall relate to return or profit gains from a pyramid scheme, plan, operation or chain process. Explanation 2 - A reference to the words “material terms” shall include buy-back policy, cooling-off period, warranty and refund policy. Explanation 3 - The goods or services shall not be considered as currently marketable and shall not be subject to the specified features if the goods or services are seasonal, discontinued or special promotional items which are disclosed to the participants at the time of sales.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All references to the Direct Sales Act 1993 in any written law or document shall, when this Act comes into operation, be construed as references to the Direct Sales and Anti-Pyramid Scheme Act 1993."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All references to the Direct Sales Act 1993 in any criminal, civil or court proceedings shall continue to apply and not be affected as if it had not been amended by this Act. Appointment made under the principal Act"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The change of name provided in section 3 of this Act shall not affect or render defective the appointment of the Controller of Direct Sales, Deputy Controllers of Direct Sales, Assistant Controllers of Direct Sales and other officers made under the principal Act before the commencement of this Act. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_f"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 2 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “door-to-door sale” the following definition: ‘ “electronic” means the technology of utilizing electrical, optical, magnetic, electromagnetic, biometric, photonic or other similar technology;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “prescribed” the following definition: ‘ “property” means movable property or immovable property of every description, whether tangible or intangible and includes an interest in any such movable property or immovable property, choses-in-action, negotiable instrument and money;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “direct sale”, by substituting for the words “and a mail order sale” the words “, a mail order sale or a sale through electronic transaction”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “purchaser” the following definition: ‘ “sales through electronic transaction” means sales of goods or services through electronic means by using marketing networks with the purpose of getting commission, bonus or any other economic advantage;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “mail order sale”, by inserting after the word “mail” the words “or any other means of mailing including through electronic means”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “services”, by inserting after the word “goods” the words ‘and the performance of work under a contract of service, and a reference to the word “services” in this Act shall relate to direct sales and pyramid scheme’. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 4 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by inserting after the words “body corporate,” wherever appearing the words “partnership or society,”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (2)(a)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “two hundred and fifty thousand” the words “one million”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “five hundred thousand” the words “two million”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c__subpara_iii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c__subpara_iv"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (2)(b)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “one hundred thousand” the words “two hundred and fifty thousand”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “two hundred and fifty thousand” the words “five hundred thousand”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the word “three” the word “five”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the word “six” the word “ten”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by inserting after the words “a body corporate,” the words “a partner in a partnership or an office-bearer of a society, as the case may be,”. Amendment of section 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 6 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(4) Any licensee who fails to comply with any conditions of the licence imposed by the Controller under subsection (1) shall be guilty of an offence.”. Deletion of section 7"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by deleting section 7. Amendment of section 11"
      }
    }
  ]
}
